# Evidence artifacts: store and check out byte-for-byte, everywhere.
#
# The repo runs core.autocrlf=true. Without this, git would normalise the Pine
# source (315 CRLF lines) to LF in the blob, so a Linux checkout would hash to
# cb94ea08... instead of 75f1914a... and the integrity test would fail on CI --
# and, worse, the equivalence claim would no longer be reproducible from the
# repository. -text disables all EOL conversion for these paths.
#
# Scoped to this directory deliberately: repo-wide EOL behaviour is unchanged.
source/** -text
fixture/** -text
